{
  "groups": [
    {
      "id": "status",
      "description": "<h2>状态信号</h2><strong>现在是什么状态？</strong><p>短状态、等级或一个需关注数量；状态文字与色块共用。</p><p>不显示时间轴、多个实体或长解释。</p><p>尺寸：1×1</p><p>参考表达：Badge / Stat</p>",
      "cards": [
        {
          "title": "当前状态",
          "width": 160,
          "height": 160,
          "status": "<span class=\"marker green\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"正常\" title=\"正常\"></span>",
          "body": "<div class=\"signal\"><strong>正常</strong></div>",
          "footer": "当前",
          "action": "<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"查看详情入口示意\" title=\"查看详情入口示意\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M17 7L7 17M8 7h9v9\"></path></svg></span>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "value",
      "description": "<h2>当前量值</h2><strong>现在是多少？</strong><p>一个数值及单位；标题给出对象，时间范围按需提供。</p><p>加宽不能只是放大数字；有基准时改用对比类别。</p><p>尺寸：1×1</p><p>参考表达：Stat</p>",
      "cards": [
        {
          "title": "响应耗时",
          "width": 160,
          "height": 160,
          "status": null,
          "body": "<div class=\"number\">42<small>ms</small></div>",
          "footer": "最近一次",
          "action": "<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"查看详情入口示意\" title=\"查看详情入口示意\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M17 7L7 17M8 7h9v9\"></path></svg></span>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "progress",
      "description": "<h2>进度与容量</h2><strong>完成多少、还差多少？</strong><p>1×1 数字；1×2 数字+线性条；1×3 再加范围/剩余；2×2 环形+一层说明。</p><p>只有定义了分母、目标或阈值才显示进度；不可用装饰条暗示事实。</p><p>尺寸：1×1、1×2、1×3；2×2 环形</p><p>参考表达：Gauge / Bar gauge</p>",
      "cards": [
        {
          "title": "采样覆盖率",
          "width": 320,
          "height": 160,
          "status": null,
          "body": "<div class=\"horizontal\"><div class=\"number\">75<small>%</small></div><div class=\"grow\"><div class=\"bar\"><i style=\"width:75%\"></i></div><span class=\"muted\">75 / 100 条</span></div></div>",
          "footer": "当前窗口",
          "action": "<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"查看详情入口示意\" title=\"查看详情入口示意\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M17 7L7 17M8 7h9v9\"></path></svg></span>"
        },
        {
          "title": "采样覆盖率",
          "width": 320,
          "height": 320,
          "status": null,
          "body": "<div class=\"ring\"><div><div class=\"number\">75<small>%</small></div></div></div><p class=\"muted\">已覆盖 75 条，尚缺 25 条</p>",
          "footer": "当前窗口",
          "action": "<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"查看详情入口示意\" title=\"查看详情入口示意\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M17 7L7 17M8 7h9v9\"></path></svg></span>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "comparison",
      "description": "<h2>基准对比</h2><strong>相对基准变化多少？</strong><p>当前值、明确基准和一个差值；宽版可补充两侧范围。</p><p>不自动把增加当作好事；完整多序列比较升级2×3或3×3。</p><p>尺寸：1×2、1×3</p><p>参考表达：Stat / Bar chart</p>",
      "cards": [
        {
          "title": "响应耗时对比",
          "width": 320,
          "height": 160,
          "status": null,
          "body": "<div class=\"horizontal\"><div class=\"number\">42<small>ms</small></div><div class=\"muted\">基准 50 ms<br><strong class=\"blue\">减少 8 ms</strong></div></div>",
          "footer": "同一观测范围",
          "action": "<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"查看详情入口示意\" title=\"查看详情入口示意\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M17 7L7 17M8 7h9v9\"></path></svg></span>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trend",
      "description": "<h2>时间趋势</h2><strong>它正在如何变化？</strong><p>小尺寸仅单序列无轴sparkline；大尺寸提供时间/数值轴、图例及需要的交互。</p><p>1×n 不放完整坐标轴和多序列。3×3展示趋势图，不把单值放在大块空白里。</p><p>尺寸：1×2、1×3 微趋势；2×3、3×3 完整图</p><p>参考表达：Time series</p>",
      "cards": [
        {
          "title": "响应耗时趋势",
          "width": 480,
          "height": 160,
          "status": null,
          "body": "<div class=\"horizontal\"><div class=\"number\">42<small>ms</small></div><svg viewBox=\"0 0 250 48\" width=\"250\" height=\"48\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"单序列微趋势示意\"><path d=\"M2 38 L25 33 L48 39 L70 27 L93 28 L116 21 L139 28 L162 15 L185 20 L208 10 L231 14 L248 4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6698ff\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path></svg></div>",
          "footer": "最近 30 分钟 · 单序列",
