        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "breakdown",
      "description": "<h2>组成与分布</h2><strong>总量由什么构成？</strong><p>2×2 一个总量、最多三个相关组成；复杂分类、直方图、热力图用大面板。</p><p>紧凑拆分不等于迷你完整图表；需要轴或多维时升级。</p><p>尺寸：2×2 简要拆分；2×3、3×3 分析图</p><p>参考表达：Bar / Pie / Histogram / Heatmap</p>",
      "cards": [
        {
          "title": "调用构成",
          "width": 320,
          "height": 320,
          "status": null,
          "body": "<div class=\"number\">120<small>次</small></div><div class=\"breakdown\"><p>读取 <b>60</b></p><div class=\"bar\"><i style=\"width:50%\"></i></div><p>写入 <b>40</b></p><div class=\"bar\"><i style=\"width:33%\"></i></div><p>其他 <b>20</b></p><div class=\"bar\"><i style=\"width:17%\"></i></div></div>",
          "footer": "同一观测范围",
          "action": "<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"查看详情入口示意\" title=\"查看详情入口示意\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M17 7L7 17M8 7h9v9\"></path></svg></span>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "history",
      "description": "<h2>状态历史</h2><strong>何时发生了状态变化？</strong><p>多条状态带、明确时间轴和状态图例；按记录展示状态变化。</p><p>不压成1×1；当前状态另由状态信号承担。</p><p>尺寸：2×3、3×3</p><p>参考表达：State timeline / Status history</p>",
      "cards": [
